# GitHub's language detection counts bytes, so the superseded Python copy in
# dcr/ outvotes the Rust in src/ and the repo gets badged Python. src/ is the
# reference implementation (see IMPLEMENTATION.md); dcr/ is kept for reference
# only, so it is excluded from the language statistics rather than deleted.
dcr/** linguist-vendored

# Generated: the PDF is built from paper/paper.frag.html by paper/build.py.
paper/*.pdf binary linguist-generated
